 massacrare la mano, ma la battaglia è soltanto agli inizi."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Five Fingers of Death","overview":"A young boxer joins a martial arts school to increase his skill so he can enter a martial arts competition. He leaves the school when he hears that a local gangster is terrorizing the town. He comes to the aid of a young singer and brings on the wrath of the local gang. He eventually enters the martial arts competition after learning iron palm technique and takes out all competition.","tagline":"Come prepared for the thrill of a lifetime!"},{"language":"zh-CN","overview":"一位老拳师突遭百武馆馆徒袭击，女儿及弟子救驾；顾自知年迈体衰，不足为罗师，亦恐邪派夺全国锦标，遂面谕罗改投尚武馆习艺，以夺魁为期许。罗途遇卖唱女遭调戏，王获救后欲以身相许，罗心中有汪遂拒王；后罗屡遭百武馆途滋扰，更为外援日本浪人所伤。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4SZ5d4p43jfSnFT8HRPRhdCLs40.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/37NOpfixwDvVJ9gTxKnNbwXE9sh.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":21964,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"zh-CN","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4SZ5d4p43jfSnFT8HRPRhdCLs40.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4SZ5d4p43jfSnFT8HRPRhdCLs40.jpg","language":"it","width":708,"height":1063},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4SZ5d4p43jfSnFT8HRPRhdCLs40.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4SZ5d4p43jfSnFT8HRPRhdCLs40.jpg","language":"it","width":708,"height":1063},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hxSZEfmHaEKkdbyaqklzbkTwFrN.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hxSZEfmHaEKkdbyaqklzbkTwFrN.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sBuf6g8fgrusB3ZV9xenjEt7ofI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sBuf6g8fgrusB3ZV9xenjEt7ofI.jpg","language":"it","width":860,"heigh